WEBVTT

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:12.130
"Hiyori-chan asked Kotobuki-san the dolphin if she can ride its back."

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:20.370
"Kotobuki-san said, 'Okay, but can I ask you one favor?'"

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:21.820
You're right.

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:26.030
These characters' names really do form "Kotobuki Hiyori."

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:29.700
So you <i>did</i> get your name from a book.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.840
She's asleep.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:41.100
Hey, I read the book just like you asked.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.590
She's out like a log.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:50.070
What a weird ghost.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:54.440
I wonder who Hiyori really is.

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:33.840
So, Hiyori.

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:35.390
Hmm?

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:38.800
Can't you do something about the design?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.820
You mean the T.S.T.'s?

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:44.540
What else would I be talking about?

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.140
What's your hang-up <i>this</i> time?

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:49.100
And what's the point? Nobody's going to see it.

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:51.350
Somebody already did!

00:02:51.350 --> 00:02:53.360
H-He saw it.

00:02:58.610 --> 00:03:02.570
Now he thinks I wear kinky panties.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.840
Yeah.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:05.890
But it'll be fine.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:09.890
Just tell him that a lot of girls wear that kind of underwear.

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:11.840
He's not going to believe that!

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:16.180
Will you relax? Things have always worked out.

00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:19.160
Mitsuki, you're always overthinking things.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:23.390
Well nothing's "worked out" for me.

00:03:23.390 --> 00:03:25.720
I've felt mortified countless times already.

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:28.310
<i>You're</i> the one who never thinks things through.

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:31.360
And you always wave it off like it's no big deal.

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.120
You know I don't wave off everything.

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:39.220
First of all, you don't even take yourself seriously.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:44.570
Are you really okay with the fact that you remember nothing about your past or the love of your life?

00:03:44.570 --> 00:03:46.650
That's just bizarre!

00:03:46.650 --> 00:03:48.790
I don't find it okay at all.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:52.480
But strangely enough, you're not even trying to remember!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:56.660
Every day you act ditzy and flighty with nothing but sex on your mind.

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.880
You don't seem serious about anything!

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:03.630
So what do you want <i>me</i> to do?

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:05.950
What can I do?

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:07.890
I really don't remember anything.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:09.990
Hiyori?

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:13.860
If I could regain my memories just through
sheer effort, it would've been done ages ago.

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.930
And besides, it won't even matter...

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:19.570
because I'm already dead!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.570
Screw you, Mitsuki!

00:04:22.810 --> 00:04:23.820
Now look here, Hiyori!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.520
What are you...

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:26.780
Huh?

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:32.040
Hiyori?

00:04:37.740 --> 00:04:39.210
Hiyori?

00:04:47.310 --> 00:04:50.730
What the heck?! What does that have to do with anything?!

00:04:50.730 --> 00:04:53.430
Do whatever floats your boat, idiot!

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:58.190
Look what I got. It's enough for everyone.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.340
Thanks, it'll be our pleasure.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:02.680
Yukina-san, good afternoon.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.110
Hello!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:07.520
Ah, a Doraya sponge cake! Can we eat it?

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.300
Sure.

00:05:08.300 --> 00:05:11.860
It's from my grandfather. He told me to give it to you guys.

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:14.720
You mean the one who works at that shrine?

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:17.730
Yeah. He says he's going to stay here for a while.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.820
Thank you very much.

00:05:19.820 --> 00:05:21.740
You're welcome.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:25.930
I sure remember him. How many years since we last met?

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:28.380
It's really been a while.

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:30.780
Hey, when should we eat this, Hiyo...

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.300
Oh yeah, she's gone.

00:05:34.300 --> 00:05:36.220
Old habits do<i> die hard.</i>

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:38.880
Oh, she's not here today.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:44.340
You mean Nanami-san?
She has to work over the weekend.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:47.060
She does? Well, I guess I'll see you.

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:49.910
You should come see Grandpa sometimes.

00:05:49.910 --> 00:05:50.890
Sure.

00:05:50.890 --> 00:05:54.490
Geez, I thought she was talking about Hiyori.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.000
This feels great!

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:13.980
I feel so liberated, like someone's taken off my chains.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:19.570
This is heaven.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:24.900
How many months has it been
since I had some alone time?

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:28.650
Ever since I met her, we've
done everything together.

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:36.290
Screw you, Mitsuki!

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:39.940
Was I... too hard on her?

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:50.640
No, it needed to be said.

00:07:03.270 --> 00:07:05.980
Mitsuki! Dinner's ready!

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:07.580
Hey!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.560
Food's ready!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.560
Time to eat, Hiyori.

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:25.360
Mitsuki?

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.090
Be quiet.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:31.740
I heard you the first time.

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:39.230
Nanami-san sure is late—again.
It must be tough having a full-time job.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.690
I humbly accept.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:44.650
Whoa, why's she in a foul mood?

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.270
I can't believe Hiyori wouldn't come back for dinner.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:52.110
Why is she so stubborn?

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.580
What's wrong?

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.020
Does it taste funny?

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.450
No, it's good.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.090
Really?

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:01.590
That's great.

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:05.370
Huh, how's this happening?

00:08:05.370 --> 00:08:07.680
Hiyori isn't even here.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:16.510
Hiyori loved these sweetened fried eggs.

00:08:17.090 --> 00:08:21.980
I like them more salty, but Hiyori
kept shoveling them down...

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:25.200
and somewhere along the
way I learned to like them.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:31.110
I even started to like sports more
ever since she showed up.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:39.460
I'm also finding it a lot easier to talk to him.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.420
Not again...

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:49.850
Why is he making my heart throb
despite Hiyori's absence?

00:08:54.580 --> 00:08:55.640
Sorry.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:08:59.680
You can take it first.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:02.130
Mitsuki, what's wrong?

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:04.940
What is this?

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:08.150
My body's reacting wildly to his touch!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:12.280
Hey, is something stuck in your throat?

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:14.620
Hey, you all right?

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:19.710
N-<i>No...</i>

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:21.820
Don't touch me!

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:25.710
Mitsuki?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.790
Hold on, I'll get it out for you.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.840
Just a little more! Hang on, Mitsuki!

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:38.550
Don't...

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.020
...touch me!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:52.240
Is it out?

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:54.020
Hey, you all right?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:57.280
Of... Of course not!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.290
Don't touch me! Sicko! Jerk! Creep!

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:07.750
S-Sicko?

00:10:07.750 --> 00:10:10.250
I was just doing the Heimlich maneuver...

00:10:11.470 --> 00:10:12.300
Hey!

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:16.790
I see, she had to go.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:18.670
Now I get why she's mad.

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:25.140
God, how can he act that stupid?

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:28.600
But, why?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:33.110
How is he making my heart
throb without Hiyori around?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:37.120
It's almost like I...

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:39.070
No, I don't!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:42.250
Honestly...

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:46.190
Where are you, Hiyori?

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:56.230
The T.S.T. is... gone?

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:06.900
The T.S.T. completely vanished.

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:11.490
I had it on just a short while ago. How did it happen?

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:12.860
Did Hiyori-

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:39.010
Mitsuki?

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.970
This looks real yummy!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.780
You really think so?

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:52.750
I swear, you have weird tastes.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:54.410
Mommy, look!

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:58.190
Up there! Look at those angels!

00:11:58.190 --> 00:11:59.590
You're right.

00:11:59.590 --> 00:12:02.020
They're having fun flying in the sky.

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.210
Hiyori!

00:12:49.210 --> 00:12:53.170
Hiyori, come on! Come back already!

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:58.950
I can't even find her outside.

00:12:58.950 --> 00:13:00.230
Has she...?

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:04.000
We were very close to the gate.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:08.720
And I had that... huge reaction at dinnertime.

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:13.190
What if that <i>filled up the gauge and sent her to Heaven?</i>

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.150
Mitsuki!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.070
I was looking for you! Where did you run off to?

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.530
It's already past eight.

00:13:23.040 --> 00:13:26.050
I was just doing some after-meal running.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:28.620
You were running? In <i>that</i> outfit?

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:32.230
I can run in whatever I want.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:37.800
Hey, your knee is bleeding!

00:13:37.800 --> 00:13:39.730
What happened?

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.760
I'm fine, just leave me alone!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.690
Now wait!

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.980
I'm not letting you wander
aimlessly into the night.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:57.190
What? Did I say something to make you cry?

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:16.920
I see.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:20.940
So you're out looking for that
friend you had a fight with.

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:28.980
And she hasn't come ba... she hasn't gone home yet.

00:14:28.980 --> 00:14:33.790
Okay. No wonder you've been feeling down.

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:36.360
I haven't been feeling down about it.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:40.210
She might have already passed on.

00:14:40.210 --> 00:14:43.380
Passed on? We're getting way ahead of ourselves.

00:14:49.330 --> 00:14:53.470
Okay, I'll help look. We'll split up.

00:14:54.320 --> 00:14:56.500
I don't think you'll find her.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:15:00.790
Don't worry. It's that girl that
comes by every day, right?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:01.660
Huh?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:05.550
You know, the one with that
huge ribbon who's into cosplay?

00:15:05.550 --> 00:15:09.500
So... you <i>can</i> see her?

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:11.230
It's not her?

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.020
It <i>is </i>her...

00:15:14.750 --> 00:15:18.850
Doesn't he think any of this is weird?

00:15:18.850 --> 00:15:21.510
Okay, let's set a rendezvous time.

00:15:21.510 --> 00:15:23.200
We'll meet up in an hour.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:28.890
If we haven't found her by 9:30, we'll call it a night and go home. Understood?

00:15:31.320 --> 00:15:33.670
Is she from around the neighborhood?

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:36.460
Yeah, she is.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:39.840
Then I'll look around the area. What's her name?

00:15:42.350 --> 00:15:43.310
Hiyori.

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.810
So Hiyori-chan. Got it.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.350
H-Hey, wait!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.680
You should drop it.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:56.220
Just leave it be. This is our problem, not yours.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:15:59.830
Look.

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:02.870
If that were the case, you wouldn't have
bothered telling me what's wrong.

00:16:02.870 --> 00:16:07.410
W-Well, that was only because you came after me.

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:10.160
But you <i>do</i> want to find her, right?

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.430
You don't have to do this on your own.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.340
For what it's worth... I'm still your brother.

00:16:19.710 --> 00:16:22.030
That girl means a lot to you, doesn't she?

00:16:24.300 --> 00:16:28.250
Okay, be sure to come back in an hour.

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:34.950
What's with all that "brother" talk? We've only known each other for a few months.

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:37.730
See?

00:16:38.250 --> 00:16:40.190
Aren't you glad, Hiyori?

00:16:41.190 --> 00:16:44.670
He's out there looking for you.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:53.080
He asked me if she means a lot to me.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.790
I wouldn't say I think nothing of her,

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:58.580
but she doesn't mean that much to me.

00:16:59.260 --> 00:17:01.500
Oh yeah! That walkway!

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:06.420
Yeah. In fact, she's a total pain in the neck.

00:17:18.770 --> 00:17:19.830
But...

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:26.080
Why?

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:30.320
You haven't even gotten lovey-dovey with him!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:33.960
Don't just up and leave!

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:38.290
You were always... so self-centered!

00:17:39.490 --> 00:17:42.910
The least you could do is say goodbye!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:44.000
Idiot!

00:17:49.070 --> 00:17:50.660
Hey!

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:55.060
Mitsuki, what are you doing there?

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:09.150
But, where did you-

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:10.320
Where did I go?

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:14.280
I ran away. I wasn't going
to come back <i>that</i> quickly.

00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.400
Oh. I guess not.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:28.380
Huh? Then why did the T.S.T. disappear?

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.880
I almost forgot, Mitsuki!

00:18:30.880 --> 00:18:32.210
There!

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:43.910
Hey!

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.990
What's <i>this?!</i>

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:49.520
Well? Don't you think it's perfect?

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:54.560
You see how it's all metallic and swag?

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:56.280
"Swag" my foot!

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.160
What the heck is this?!

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:04.970
You're asking me? I did it because
you hated the old design.

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:11.060
I went all the way to the Interstice of Time and asked them to change it for you.

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:15.060
Wait. So why did the T.S.T. disappear?

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:17.680
Oh, you thought it disappeared?

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:21.800
They just retrieved it temporarily to change the design.

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.730
Oh? You don't like this design either?

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:30.100
No! I don't like the T.S.T. <i>period!</i>

00:19:30.100 --> 00:19:34.050
Change it back! I'd rather have the other one!

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:37.700
Hmm, you're putting me in a spot here...

00:19:38.100 --> 00:19:46.040
When it disappeared, I thought you had already... passed on to Heaven.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:52.940
And we had that fight...
Don't scare me like that, idiot!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:02.070
Sorry I had you worried.

00:20:02.920 --> 00:20:06.060
I'm sorry for all that stuff I said.

00:20:10.740 --> 00:20:17.010
Just so you know, despite what I said back there, I wasn't actually worried.

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:19.540
Huh? Is that true?

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:21.620
You were totally worrying!

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.280
No I wasn't.

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.100
Come on, you so were!

00:20:27.260 --> 00:20:28.750
Forget you!

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.210
Hey! Wait up, Mitsuki!

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:35.720
Excuse me, I'm looking for someone.

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:39.280
It's a girl with a huge ribbon on her head.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:42.960
And she has these small wings on her back.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:44.680
Have you seen her?

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:49.180
Now look, Hiyori, like I've said before,

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:52.150
I <i>did</i> hate the old design,

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.900
but this is outrageous!

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:00.860
Are you listening?! Turn it back to the old one!

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:06.170
Yeah, but I can't ask them to
switch designs at the drop of a hat.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:09.180
They did that as a special favor to you.

00:21:09.180 --> 00:21:12.000
I didn't even ask for a favor!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:13.760
It'll be fine.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.900
A pair of normal panties will cover it up anyway.

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:20.300
Huh?

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:23.270
A lot of it is showing still.

00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:26.220
God! Can't you do something?!

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.980
I'll get back to you.

00:21:32.070 --> 00:21:34.800
Please hug me tight.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:37.400
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:40.280
Come closer to me.

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:43.160
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:21:54.260 --> 00:21:56.480
I want you to notice

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:59.720
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:02.020
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:05.180
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:05.180 --> 00:22:07.550
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:10.770
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:13.030
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:16.110
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:16.110 --> 00:22:18.740
These ordinary days

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:21.620
are something special to me.

00:22:21.620 --> 00:22:27.120
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:32.840
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:32.840 --> 00:22:38.260
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:38.260 --> 00:22:40.970
You’re my man with the charming do

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:43.750
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:22:43.750 --> 00:22:46.460
Well you see, that’s because

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:49.480
I love you very much.

00:22:49.480 --> 00:22:52.020
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:54.690
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:57.560
I want to keep on loving you

00:22:57.560 --> 00:23:00.190
always and forever more.

00:23:04.590 --> 00:23:07.180
There, I had them change it back to normal.

00:23:07.180 --> 00:23:08.990
Are we all good?

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:10.640
Thank god...

00:23:10.640 --> 00:23:14.750
You really <i>do</i> like the T.S.T. despite all your griping!

00:23:14.750 --> 00:23:16.460
N-No!

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:18.840
I still hate it!

00:23:20.430 --> 00:23:23.970
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual!</i>

00:23:23.970 --> 00:23:26.470
"They'll wake up the next
morning to drink coffee!"

00:23:26.470 --> 00:23:28.430
This is all thanks
to you, Mitsuki.

00:23:28.430 --> 00:23:30.470
This is a nice bath.

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:33.190
But you and Yukina-san
were going at it!

00:23:33.190 --> 00:23:34.480
Go to sleep.

00:23:34.480 --> 00:23:36.230
Found you, Yuuya!

00:23:36.230 --> 00:23:38.480
I'm finally here!

00:23:38.480 --> 00:23:39.980
Over there?
